Print the language reference, or one topic of it

Usage: kashika ref [OPTIONS] [TOPIC]

Arguments:
  [TOPIC]  A topic (rules, syntax, anchors, paths, sizing, text, shapes, styles, recipes, examples, lints, metrics, cli, limits) or a diagnostic code; without one, the core guide

Options:
      --json  Wrap the page in a JSON envelope
  -h, --help  Print help
